# devicetree_n48.dtpatch - N48 DeviceTree operations for dtbpatch
# source: 5c6 common/devicetree + n48/devicetree + profile native6-wifi-candidate
# input: raw Apple DT blob (n42-devicetree.dtb, iPhone5,2 10B350 stock DeviceTree payload)
# usage: dtbpatch <in.dtb> <patch-file> <out.dtb>
# value tokens: <hex> = bytes, "-" = empty value, ACCEPTED-only "-" = property absent,
#               ACCEPTED-only "+" = property present with empty value

